        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nskinparam backgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityBackgroundColor white\nskinparam ActivityBorderColor black\nskinparam ActivityFontColor black\nskinparam ArrowColor black\nskinparam PartitionBackgroundColor white\nskinparam PartitionBorderColor black\nskinparam swimlaneBorderColor black\nskinparam swimlaneTitleFontSize 16\nskinparam swimlaneTitleFontStyle bold\nskinparam shadowing false\n\n|Pengunjung / User|\nstart\n:Buka Website;\n\n|Sistem|\n:Tampilkan Halaman Beranda;\n\n|Pengunjung / User|\nswitch (Pilih Menu di Beranda?)\ncase ( Baca Nasehat )\n  |Pengunjung / User|\n  :Klik Kartu Nasehat;\n  |Sistem|\n  :Ambil Data &amp; Tampilkan Detail Nasehat;\n  |Pengunjung / User|\n  :Membaca Detail Nasehat;\n\ncase ( Lihat Galeri )\n  |Pengunjung / User|\n  :Klik Lihat Semua Galeri;\n  |Sistem|\n  :Ambil Data &amp; Tampilkan Halaman Galeri;\n  |Pengunjung / User|\n  :Melihat Seluruh Foto;\n\ncase ( Hubungi WA )\n  |Pengunjung / User|\n  :Klik Tombol WhatsApp;\n  |Sistem|\n  :Buka Aplikasi WhatsApp;\nendswitch\n\n|Pengunjung / User|\nstop\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="ECOy2BSH5h7HllO4YNSo-292">
