        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    actor Admin\n    participant UI as Frontend (Browser)\n    participant API as API Route (/api/nasehat)\n    participant Service as DB Service (lib/db.ts)\n    participant DB as SQLite Database\n    \n    Admin-&gt;&gt;UI: Isi form artikel &amp; klik Simpan\n    activate UI\n    UI-&gt;&gt;API: HTTP POST /api/nasehat (payload: title, content, dll)\n    activate API\n    API-&gt;&gt;Service: createArticle(data)\n    activate Service\n    Service-&gt;&gt;DB: execute: INSERT INTO articles...\n    activate DB\n    DB--&gt;&gt;Service: row_id inserted\n    deactivate DB\n    Service-&gt;&gt;DB: saveDb() (Tulis buffer ke file .db)\n    activate DB\n    DB--&gt;&gt;Service: success\n    deactivate DB\n    Service--&gt;&gt;API: ArticleRow object\n    deactivate Service\n    API--&gt;&gt;UI: Response JSON 200 OK\n    deactivate API\n    UI--&gt;&gt;Admin: Tampilkan Notifikasi \&quot;Berhasil Disimpan\&quot;\n    deactivate UI&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="CiGZ1kQsGymccHeP1tId-58">
